{
  "id": "hedda_talk",
  "start": "greet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "greet",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "Hedda looks up, and keeps drying the same cup. \"You'll have heard about the barrow, then.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Sit down or don't,\" says Hedda. \"But if you're going up the sheep field, hear me first.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "ask_barrow",
          "text": "What about the barrow?",
          "effects": [
            {
              "emit": {
                "event": "startQuest",
                "data": {
                  "quest": "the_open_door"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "grantItem": {
                "target": {
                  "ref": "actor.id"
                },
                "item": "bandages",
                "quantity": 2
              }
            }
          ],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "the_draught",
          "requires": {
            "quests": [
              {
                "quest": "the_open_door",
                "status": "unstarted"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "ask_village",
          "text": "Tell me about Hollowdene.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "the_village"
        },
        {
          "id": "leave",
          "text": "Later.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": [
        {
          "requires": {
            "quests": [
              {
                "quest": "the_open_door",
                "status": "active"
              }
            ],
            "flags": [
              {
                "flag": "barrow_cleared",
                "equals": true
              }
            ]
          },
          "goto": "well_done"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the_draught",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"Six hundred years that door's stood open and it's never once mattered. Air went *in*. My grandmother knew that, her grandmother knew it.\" She sets the cup down. \"Fortnight since, it turned. Air comes out now. And two nights after that we lost a dog.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "what_out",
          "text": "What came out?",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "what_out"
        },
        {
          "id": "go_now",
          "text": "We'll go and look.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "go_now"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "what_out",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"If I knew that I'd not be asking strangers.\" A pause. \"It was a dog once. That much I'll say.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "go_now",
          "text": "We'll go and look.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "go_now"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "go_now",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"Take the bandages. Take the sheep track, not the lane — the lane goes round.\" She almost smiles. \"And come back.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "done",
          "text": "We will.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "well_done",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"You came back,\" says Hedda, and means it."
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "tell_her",
          "text": "It was a ward. Somebody opened it.",
          "effects": [
            {
              "setFlag": {
                "flag": "hedda_told",
                "value": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "onceOnly": true,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "she_goes_quiet"
        },
        {
          "id": "say_nothing",
          "text": "It's dealt with.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "she_goes_quiet"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": [],
      "remembers": "ward_restored"
    },
    {
      "id": "she_goes_quiet",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"A ward,\" she says, slowly. \"Then you'll want Aurenhal, and you'll want to be quick about it. There's a woman at the chapel who'll tell you what a ward is. Ulla. She came down from the ice and she's not said why.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "thanks",
          "text": "Thank you.",
          "effects": [
            {
              "adjustReputation": {
                "faction": "the_keepers",
                "amount": 4
              }
            }
          ],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "the_village",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "\"Eleven roofs, a well, and a road that goes through rather than to us. It suits everybody.\""
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "back",
          "text": "Right.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "goto": "greet"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "redirectWhen": []
    }
  ]
}
